-- examples/checks/agg-tag-ts-1-data.rofl — agg_tag_ts, a world both engines
-- answer: plain facts both load, and beside them two fixtures each engine
-- refuses, each for a reason naming the tag: both engines refuse a tag under
-- well-founded semantics. Neither fixture reaches the world, so
-- the two states are one.
edb(tgt_e).
tgt_e(a, b, 1).
tgt_seen(A) :- tgt_e(A, _, _).
